   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **ween2006-07-14.mk4.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 20 songs; 84 min; rated 4.5/5 by 2 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer calls the sound quality top notch, the best-sounding Ween recording they've found on the Archive; Vocals from Gener sit slightly too loud in the mix, though the reviewer forgives it because he plays so strongly [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer says the set lacks a long 15+ minute jam, but is among the best festival sets [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2006-07-14.mk4.flac16**: source: Schoeps mk4 (ORTF) > kc5 > cmc6 > Oade m148 > mod. SBM-1 > D8 (16/44) [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by JamBase: [Flood Of Ween Videos Hits YouTube Including 2006 All Good Festival Set](https://www.jambase.com/article/ween-videos-2006-all-good-festival) [5]",
